

>> usedMemory1 := 0.
>> usedMemory2 := 0.
>> usedMemory3 := 0.
>> usedMemory4 := 0.

Uhlelo ukuphathwa-kwenkumbulo: 0.

>> o := Into okusha.
>> o2 := Into okusha.
Okuphumayo bhala: o Lutho?, umugqa-omusha.
Okuphumayo bhala: o uhlobo, umugqa-omusha.
Okuphumayo bhala: ( o kuyefana: o ), umugqa-omusha.
Okuphumayo bhala: ( o kuyefana: o2 ), umugqa-omusha.
Okuphumayo bhala: o mina-uqobo, umugqa-omusha.
Okuphumayo bhala: ( o yenza kwenziwe ), umugqa-omusha.

Uhlelo hlanza.

usedMemory1 := (Uhlelo inkumbulo ? 0).


